flowchart TD
    A["Infancy (0-2 years)"] --> B["Childhood (3-12 years)"]
    B --> C["Adolescence (13-18 years)"]
    C --> D["Adulthood (19-40 years)"]
    D --> E["Maturity (41-65 years)"]
    E --> F["Elderhood (65+ years)"]
    F --> G["Legacy & Intergenerational Identity"]

    %% Infancy
    A:::stage -->|Parent's Attestation| A1["Validated parent signs cryptographic attestation"]
    A:::stage -->|Witnesses| A2["Midwife, relatives, community elder form first Sangam"]

    %% Childhood
    B:::stage -->|Independent Recognitions| B1["Teachers, librarians, neighbors, coaches add signatures"]
    B:::stage -->|Ledger Growth| B2["Identity expands through being seen & recognized"]

    %% Adolescence
    C:::stage -->|Autonomous Sangam| C1["Friendships, civic participation, early work"]
    C:::stage -->|Temporal Depth| C2["Ledger spans many years, impossible to fake"]

    %% Adulthood
    D:::stage -->|Professional Identity| D1["Work relationships, civic duties, social networks"]
    D:::stage -->|Relational Breadth| D2["Hundreds of attestations across diverse contexts"]

    %% Maturity
    E:::stage -->|Mentorship & Leadership| E1["Guiding younger generations, institutional roles"]
    E:::stage -->|Community Anchoring| E2["Long-term civic participation, sustained recognition"]

    %% Elderhood
    F:::stage -->|Wisdom & Continuity| F1["Recognition as elder, custodian of collective memory"]
    F:::stage -->|Intergenerational Sangam| F2["Attestations from descendants, students, community"]

    %% Legacy
    G:::stage -->|Historical Density| G1["Ledger reflects decades of layered attestations"]
    G:::stage -->|Proof of Personhood| G2["Identity persists beyond lifespan, woven into collective record"]